# ACCEPTANCE: cu-003

Feature test T6 (criterion 7): compile a new-schema batch whose regular CU omits ACCEPTANCE; assert non-zero exit, stderr names the CU id and the missing section, and neither <out>/cu-<id>.itr nor <out>/cu-<id>/cu-<id>.itr exists for the offender. Feature test T4 (criteria 5-6): a legacy component-less batch yields <out>/cu-old/cu-old.itr, no <out>/cu-old.itr, no component files.
